1
00:00:25,210 --> 00:00:29,320
[Live Forever]

2
00:00:30,410 --> 00:00:32,920
[Episode 8]

3
00:00:36,430 --> 00:00:37,430
So,

4
00:00:39,470 --> 00:00:41,670
you took the surname Ning because of me?

5
00:00:54,960 --> 00:00:55,420
Then...

6
00:00:58,350 --> 00:01:00,830
he was already obsessed with me back then.

7
00:01:00,860 --> 00:01:02,110
Narcissistic personality.

8
00:01:02,110 --> 00:01:03,430
Is there any cure for that?

9
00:01:03,430 --> 00:01:05,489
From a professional perspective...

10
00:01:06,870 --> 00:01:07,800
it's hard to say.

11
00:01:08,310 --> 00:01:09,640
It's really hard to say.

12
00:01:11,070 --> 00:01:13,270
But I truly waited a very, very long time

13
00:01:14,310 --> 00:01:16,230
for the day we reunited.

14
00:01:18,770 --> 00:01:25,060
[Duansi Palace]

15
00:01:56,560 --> 00:01:57,479
Who are you?

16
00:02:31,560 --> 00:02:33,420
Ning Changyue of the Yulin Guard.

17
00:02:33,870 --> 00:02:36,400
Greetings, Your Highness Princess Ningjia.

18
00:02:36,630 --> 00:02:37,750
Yulin Guard?

19
00:02:39,030 --> 00:02:40,360
What do you want with me?

20
00:02:54,150 --> 00:02:55,030
This is for you.

21
00:02:55,310 --> 00:02:57,590
If you're thirsty, hungry, or in pain,

22
00:02:57,680 --> 00:02:59,540
just blow this whistle to find me.

23
00:03:06,680 --> 00:03:08,280
It's you.

24
00:03:11,960 --> 00:03:13,590
You became a Yulin Guard.

25
00:03:14,120 --> 00:03:15,890
Doing quite well for yourself, huh?

26
00:03:15,890 --> 00:03:17,020
You've grown taller

27
00:03:17,240 --> 00:03:18,240
and stronger.

28
00:03:18,520 --> 00:03:20,120
You seem well-trained, too.

29
00:03:20,720 --> 00:03:23,440
If not for Your Highness saving my life
that day,

30
00:03:23,710 --> 00:03:25,710
I probably wouldn't have survived.

31
00:03:25,750 --> 00:03:26,610
Your Highness,

32
00:03:26,670 --> 00:03:27,740
I am here to repay that debt.

33
00:03:27,740 --> 00:03:28,600
Repay the debt?

34
00:03:28,990 --> 00:03:30,780
Is this how you repay a debt?

35
00:03:30,800 --> 00:03:31,960
That hurt like hell.

36
00:03:33,800 --> 00:03:35,910
Forget it. Don't take it to heart.

37
00:03:35,910 --> 00:03:38,680
Anyway, I was just

38
00:03:39,030 --> 00:03:41,310
being a bit nosy.

39
00:03:50,000 --> 00:03:51,360
Make a deal with me.

40
00:03:57,590 --> 00:03:58,400
Your Highness.

41
00:03:58,400 --> 00:03:59,660
Teach me martial arts,

42
00:03:59,910 --> 00:04:01,470
riding and archery.

43
00:04:02,030 --> 00:04:02,840
Tell me,

44
00:04:02,980 --> 00:04:04,980
what the price of grain is

45
00:04:05,080 --> 00:04:06,560
and how much cloth costs

46
00:04:06,560 --> 00:04:08,240
in the West Market and East District.

47
00:04:08,240 --> 00:04:09,240
How can a painting

48
00:04:09,360 --> 00:04:10,760
or a piece of calligraphy

49
00:04:10,760 --> 00:04:12,070
be exchanged

50
00:04:12,150 --> 00:04:14,150
for enough copper coins to survive?

51
00:04:16,040 --> 00:04:17,070
In exchange,

52
00:04:17,360 --> 00:04:19,310
I can teach you how to read and draw,

53
00:04:19,600 --> 00:04:20,720
if you want to.

54
00:04:24,310 --> 00:04:25,240
May I?

55
00:04:25,950 --> 00:04:26,600
Of course.

56
00:04:32,920 --> 00:04:35,600
I'm willing to serve Your Highness.

57
00:04:36,480 --> 00:04:38,000
But what I hope is,

58
00:04:39,120 --> 00:04:41,040
not a guard serving a princess,

59
00:04:41,440 --> 00:04:43,360
but a person named Ning Changyue

60
00:04:43,390 --> 00:04:45,320
teaching a person named Song Yiqiu

61
00:04:46,040 --> 00:04:47,900
what it truly means to have a life.

62
00:04:49,240 --> 00:04:50,270
To have a life?

63
00:04:52,870 --> 00:04:53,720
Your Highness,

64
00:04:53,720 --> 00:04:54,850
I don't understand.

65
00:04:54,920 --> 00:04:56,430
Call me Song Yiqiu!

66
00:05:01,160 --> 00:05:01,720
Alright.

67
00:05:03,560 --> 00:05:04,240
Song...

68
00:05:06,480 --> 00:05:07,560
Song Yiqiu.

69
00:05:08,240 --> 00:05:09,560
It's been a long time,

70
00:05:10,750 --> 00:05:12,000
Ning Changyue.

71
00:05:18,110 --> 00:05:19,750
To me back then,

72
00:05:20,630 --> 00:05:21,360
I didn't know

73
00:05:21,360 --> 00:05:23,420
what freedom and having a life meant.

74
00:05:24,560 --> 00:05:26,120
But if she wanted them,

75
00:05:27,120 --> 00:05:29,120
I would definitely give them to her.

76
00:05:32,390 --> 00:05:32,990
By the way,

77
00:05:42,310 --> 00:05:43,240
call me anytime.

78
00:05:45,800 --> 00:05:46,270
Got it.

79
00:06:37,940 --> 00:06:39,950
Having been in this palace for so long,

80
00:06:39,950 --> 00:06:42,750
I can't believe
I still trusted someone so easily.

81
00:07:56,500 --> 00:07:58,230
I made this especially for you.

82
00:08:03,110 --> 00:08:04,060
Build up your strength first.

83
00:08:04,060 --> 00:08:05,190
If you can't even draw the bow,

84
00:08:05,190 --> 00:08:06,850
how can you practice archery?

85
00:08:08,040 --> 00:08:10,300
You certainly get straight to the point.

86
00:08:12,430 --> 00:08:15,030
Didn't you say
you wanted to practice archery?

87
00:08:31,310 --> 00:08:31,950
Here.

88
00:08:38,270 --> 00:08:38,909
Like this.

89
00:08:48,440 --> 00:08:49,360
Raise your arm.

90
00:09:05,320 --> 00:09:06,440
Drop shoulders.

91
00:09:06,840 --> 00:09:07,360
Song Yiqiu.

92
00:09:07,360 --> 00:09:08,360
Calm the mind.

93
00:09:15,770 --> 00:09:18,230
This is osmanthus cake
from the West Market.

94
00:09:18,390 --> 00:09:19,480
The West Market?

95
00:09:20,560 --> 00:09:21,960
The West Market is bustling and noisy.

96
00:09:21,960 --> 00:09:23,110
Vendors gather there.

97
00:09:23,110 --> 00:09:24,630
It's packed with
a constant stream of people.

98
00:09:24,630 --> 00:09:26,960
It has the liveliest earthly atmosphere.

99
00:09:27,320 --> 00:09:27,910
Qiu,

100
00:09:41,630 --> 00:09:43,690
this is a kite from the East District.

101
00:09:44,980 --> 00:09:46,040
The East District?

102
00:09:47,440 --> 00:09:49,270
The East District is full of workshops.

103
00:09:49,270 --> 00:09:50,410
There are many tailoring,

104
00:09:50,410 --> 00:09:52,740
blacksmith, and silversmith workshops.

105
00:09:53,850 --> 00:09:55,050
What are you drawing?

106
00:09:55,270 --> 00:09:56,400
You look so focused.

107
00:09:58,750 --> 00:09:59,440
Nothing.

108
00:09:59,910 --> 00:10:02,440
Just casually sketching
the palace scenery.

109
00:10:03,870 --> 00:10:05,440
You're drawing the imperial kitchen...

110
00:10:05,440 --> 00:10:07,240
Its side door is for servants,

111
00:10:07,630 --> 00:10:09,090
so it's rarely patrolled.

112
00:10:09,760 --> 00:10:11,040
You observe

113
00:10:12,180 --> 00:10:13,260
quite carefully.

114
00:10:13,980 --> 00:10:16,440
You're not drawing
ordinary palace scenery.

115
00:10:16,440 --> 00:10:18,270
You're trying to find a way out,

116
00:10:18,630 --> 00:10:19,320
aren't you?

117
00:10:25,420 --> 00:10:27,200
How can you fail at the simplest

118
00:10:27,200 --> 00:10:28,750
tracing?

119
00:10:32,100 --> 00:10:32,820
I'm sorry.

120
00:10:38,670 --> 00:10:41,550
You don't need to grip the brush so hard.

121
00:10:43,070 --> 00:10:44,530
Once your heart is steady,

122
00:10:45,000 --> 00:10:46,460
your brush will be steady.

123
00:10:47,630 --> 00:10:48,870
Relax your hand a bit.

124
00:10:49,180 --> 00:10:50,310
I'll hold your hand,

125
00:10:51,240 --> 00:10:52,640
and we'll draw together.

126
00:10:53,600 --> 00:10:54,550
Focus.

127
00:11:33,790 --> 00:11:34,650
Ning Changyue,

128
00:11:34,670 --> 00:11:35,470
come here now!

129
00:11:40,260 --> 00:11:42,300
Over the years, using my memory

130
00:11:42,330 --> 00:11:44,380
and overheard information,
I drew this map.

131
00:11:44,380 --> 00:11:44,950
Look,

132
00:11:45,200 --> 00:11:46,800
is this palace map accurate?

133
00:11:47,000 --> 00:11:47,750
Pretty much.

134
00:11:49,010 --> 00:11:49,970
At 7:45 PM,

135
00:11:49,990 --> 00:11:51,240
the guards in the east corridor
change shifts.

136
00:11:51,240 --> 00:11:52,750
There will be a window
of one incense stick's time.

137
00:11:52,750 --> 00:11:53,240
Here.

138
00:11:54,450 --> 00:11:56,690
The alchemy room shifts every hour.

139
00:11:56,720 --> 00:11:59,080
There will be a brief moment
of chaos during the shift.

140
00:11:59,080 --> 00:12:00,150
If we go this way,

141
00:12:01,000 --> 00:12:02,130
and if all goes well,

142
00:12:02,240 --> 00:12:04,100
we can leave the palace smoothly.

143
00:12:04,510 --> 00:12:05,080
Qiu,

144
00:12:05,360 --> 00:12:06,760
I'll take you somewhere.

145
00:12:07,720 --> 00:12:09,920
Only when looking from here do I realize

146
00:12:10,600 --> 00:12:12,130
just how huge the palace is.

147
00:12:16,120 --> 00:12:17,050
A shooting star!

148
00:12:17,440 --> 00:12:18,670
We are so lucky.

149
00:12:23,960 --> 00:12:24,480
Yeah.

150
00:12:26,390 --> 00:12:27,270
So lucky.

151
00:12:28,870 --> 00:12:29,930
Make a wish, quick!

152
00:12:30,240 --> 00:12:30,670
Hurry!

153
00:12:33,160 --> 00:12:38,360
♪ Parting clouds to pluck the moon ♪

154
00:12:38,970 --> 00:12:43,600
♪ Brewing a pot of bygone years ♪

155
00:12:44,800 --> 00:12:46,360
♪ Cold candlelight ♪

156
00:12:46,380 --> 00:12:50,350
♪ Waking the shadow to soothe my sorrow ♪

157
00:12:50,550 --> 00:12:55,600
♪ Drunk for three live
with no dream returned ♪

158
00:12:55,750 --> 00:13:01,360
♪ How to break this illusion
without letting go? ♪

159
00:13:01,380 --> 00:13:07,430
♪ Returning to wander the mortal realm ♪

160
00:13:03,750 --> 00:13:04,950
What did you wish for?

161
00:13:07,450 --> 00:13:09,830
♪ Like her like yesterday unchanging ♪

162
00:13:09,600 --> 00:13:11,030
It won't come true if I say it out loud.

163
00:13:09,880 --> 00:13:13,730
♪ Carved hairpin filled
with endless sighs ♪

164
00:13:13,760 --> 00:13:18,970
♪ Fate sees through my hidden thoughts ♪

165
00:13:13,790 --> 00:13:15,030
Stingy.

166
00:13:19,170 --> 00:13:21,270
♪ Like promise like regret like love ♪

167
00:13:21,300 --> 00:13:25,380
♪ Loving and hurting
yet meeting too late ♪

168
00:13:21,360 --> 00:13:22,200
Why don't you ask

169
00:13:22,200 --> 00:13:23,240
what I wished for?

170
00:13:24,440 --> 00:13:25,170
Freedom.

171
00:13:25,410 --> 00:13:30,240
♪ Who holds more regret
in this entanglement? ♪

172
00:13:25,910 --> 00:13:27,240
You've said it three thousand times.

173
00:13:27,240 --> 00:13:28,840
It's etched into your bones.

174
00:13:32,600 --> 00:13:33,360
Qiu,

175
00:13:34,390 --> 00:13:35,990
on the seventh of next month,

176
00:13:37,120 --> 00:13:38,850
I will get you out of the palace.

177
00:13:44,840 --> 00:13:46,390
At 7:45 PM,

178
00:13:46,720 --> 00:13:48,480
the guards in the east corridor
change shifts.

179
00:13:48,480 --> 00:13:50,630
There is a gap
of one incense stick's time.

180
00:13:50,630 --> 00:13:51,630
The seventh?

181
00:14:03,080 --> 00:14:04,080
This is...

182
00:14:05,600 --> 00:14:07,010
On the seventh of next month,

183
00:14:07,010 --> 00:14:08,630
the higher-ups have shown mercy

184
00:14:08,630 --> 00:14:10,310
and are letting you leave the palace.

185
00:14:10,310 --> 00:14:12,760
Come over here and register your names.

186
00:14:14,120 --> 00:14:16,120
That's great. We can finally leave!

187
00:14:17,960 --> 00:14:18,960
Thank you, my lord!

188
00:14:18,960 --> 00:14:20,000
Don't rush.

189
00:14:20,110 --> 00:14:20,990
One at a time.

190
00:14:21,120 --> 00:14:22,480
I can finally go home.

191
00:14:22,690 --> 00:14:23,530
My lord!

192
00:14:23,560 --> 00:14:24,890
Have mercy, my lord!

193
00:14:25,130 --> 00:14:26,530
I can't leave the palace.

194
00:14:26,790 --> 00:14:28,120
I can't leave!

195
00:14:28,120 --> 00:14:30,750
Thank you, my lord.

196
00:14:31,080 --> 00:14:33,870
The medicine testers
who survived the last failed trials

197
00:14:33,870 --> 00:14:36,240
will be dismissed
from the palace on the seventh.

198
00:14:36,240 --> 00:14:37,570
Xiaoyuan is one of them.

199
00:14:38,140 --> 00:14:39,320
You will swap clothes with her

200
00:14:39,320 --> 00:14:40,320
and take her place to leave the palace.

201
00:14:40,320 --> 00:14:41,270
I swap with her?

202
00:14:44,550 --> 00:14:45,150
No way.

203
00:14:46,960 --> 00:14:47,910
No way.

204
00:14:48,700 --> 00:14:51,250
The chance for a medicine tester
to leave alive is so rare.

205
00:14:51,250 --> 00:14:53,040
How could I steal her chance to live

206
00:14:53,040 --> 00:14:54,560
just for my own freedom?

207
00:14:54,580 --> 00:14:55,440
Your Highness,

208
00:14:56,120 --> 00:14:57,580
I am doing this willingly.

209
00:14:57,960 --> 00:14:59,090
I entered the palace

210
00:14:59,200 --> 00:15:01,480
to look for my long-lost brother.

211
00:15:02,320 --> 00:15:04,240
Since he is still missing,

212
00:15:04,910 --> 00:15:06,390
I cannot leave.

213
00:15:10,720 --> 00:15:12,670
As long as you can safely
leave the palace on the seventh,

214
00:15:12,670 --> 00:15:14,150
I will hide her for a while.

215
00:15:14,450 --> 00:15:15,560
Once the heat dies down,

216
00:15:15,560 --> 00:15:17,260
I'll find her a position in the palace.

217
00:15:17,260 --> 00:15:18,840
This way, she can make a living

218
00:15:18,840 --> 00:15:20,510
and continue looking for her brother.

219
00:15:20,510 --> 00:15:22,030
This palace isn't that big.

220
00:15:22,030 --> 00:15:22,870
As long as she stays,

221
00:15:22,870 --> 00:15:24,530
they will meet again someday.

222
00:15:27,120 --> 00:15:28,250
The freedom you want

223
00:15:28,790 --> 00:15:30,120
is right in front of you.

224
00:15:47,090 --> 00:15:48,160
After you leave the palace later,

225
00:15:48,160 --> 00:15:49,380
your new identity documents

226
00:15:49,380 --> 00:15:50,290
and transit tokens

227
00:15:50,290 --> 00:15:52,390
are buried
under the third old locust tree.

228
00:15:52,390 --> 00:15:53,480
Turn left after exiting,

229
00:15:53,480 --> 00:15:54,740
go through two alleys,

230
00:15:55,120 --> 00:15:56,550
and when you reach the third narrow door,

231
00:15:56,550 --> 00:15:58,270
push it open and you'll find our contact.

232
00:15:58,270 --> 00:15:59,600
Carriages, horses, and food,

233
00:15:59,600 --> 00:16:02,150
along with the route to Nanjing,
are all arranged.

234
00:16:02,150 --> 00:16:02,840
Okay.

235
00:16:04,390 --> 00:16:05,250
What about you?

236
00:16:26,480 --> 00:16:27,750
Your Highness,

237
00:16:27,770 --> 00:16:30,810
are you trying to elope with someone?
